# Windows script hosts want CRLF, and these particular files ship to end users
# inside the screensaver zip and run on their machines. Pin the endings so a
# checkout on a machine without core.autocrlf still packages working scripts.
#
# Deliberately no blanket `* text=auto` here: this repository has years of
# history checked out with core.autocrlf=true, and adding it would renormalise
# large numbers of unrelated files on the next checkout.
*.bat    text eol=crlf
*.cmd    text eol=crlf
*.ps1    text eol=crlf
*.cs     text eol=crlf
